Biohub — Cell Tracking During Development

The tracking models and dataset reader in upstream/ are from Pilkwang Kim's
Biohub Tracking Support Pack (pilkwang/biohub-tracking-support-pack-50ep-v1,
CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

The post-processing follows Frontier947 Readmit v1 by Teddy Tennant
(thtennant/biohub-frontier947-readmit-v1) and Geometric Fusion by Aman Atar
(amanatar/biohub-geometric-fusion), both Apache-2.0. The harmonic fusion stack
follows flexonafft's Biohub Harmonic Fusion, with the mutual-support rule from
Yusuke Togashi's notebook yusuketogashi/no-hack-biohub-cell-another-approch-3rd
(version 18, CC0).

The refinement architecture and sampling follow Anvith Pothula's Biohub x138
(anvithpothula/biohub-0-953-lb-original, Apache-2.0). The final 13-head ensemble
was trained and integrated by Adil Khabibullin (Mega Shake UP).

